### Data & Model Exclusions Notice

This MIT License applies solely to the original source code and documentation of Melovia.
It does **NOT** grant copyright or proprietary ownership over:
1. Music metadata, recording identifiers, and tag folksonomies, which are sourced from
   [MusicBrainz](https://musicbrainz.org/) (CC0 / Open Database License ODbL) and
   [ListenBrainz](https://listenbrainz.org/) (CC0).
2. Acoustic descriptors and audio features, which are sourced from
   [AcousticBrainz](https://acousticbrainz.org/) (CC0).
3. Pre-trained transformer neural network weights (such as `all-MiniLM-L6-v2`), which remain
   governed by their respective open source licenses (Apache License 2.0).

Users and distributors must comply with all upstream licenses when obtaining, reproducing,
or redistributing catalog data files and model weights.
